# Module order for the game build = memory order of the final image.
# tools/build_brucelee.py concatenates these into build/brucelee.mac
# and assembles with bin/macro11.  boot.mac must stay first (pads
# itself to 1000, where main.mac's MAIN_START region begins); nothing
# may sit between ppu.mac's PP_START and ppu_end.mac's PP_END (that
# block, including the music data, is copied into PPU RAM);
# gamevars.mac and tail.mac close the layout.
src/defs.mac
src/gamevars.mac
src/boot.mac
src/main.mac
src/menu.mac
src/title.mac
src/flow.mac
src/game.mac
src/chamber.mac
src/entity.mac
src/ai.mac
src/collide.mac
src/pickup.mac
src/hazard.mac
src/score.mac
src/input.mac
src/gfx.mac
src/ppucomm.mac
src/ppu.mac
build/data_music.mac
src/ppu_end.mac
build/font8.mac
build/strings.mac
build/data_tiles.mac
build/data_sprites.mac
build/data_chambers.mac
build/data_hud.mac
build/data_title.mac
src/tail.mac
